-- parent's name, e.g. 'Doguale (Tahtay Adiyabo)', or its level_value_id where
-- the parent is shared too: master data has a unique index on
-- level_value_mnemonic (ux_geo_level_values_mnemonic), and the plain names
-- failed the whole transaction on it. display_name keeps the plain name.
